# Characters people play. These used to be committed so a hero could move between machines by
# `git push`, which worked but made play files part of the source -- and the test suite ended up
# reading one as a fixture, so three tests passed only on the machine that had played. Fixtures
# live in app/test/fixtures/ now, and a character is yours to keep wherever you like.
saves/*.hero
